- [ ] Record one of `intrinsic_and_caller`, `intrinsic_only`, or
      `execution_receipt_only` in terminal evidence.
- [ ] Keep owner-lifetime cleanup in transaction/terminal events rather than
      claiming it in earlier command-finished events.
- [ ] Extend controller formatting and result rendering without interpreting
      driver semantics or cleanup precedence.
- [ ] Add a fake-clock/fake-scheduler command-engine harness.
- [ ] Add table-driven conformance helpers for every command kind,
      intrinsic-verification policy, and execution-retry policy.
- [ ] Cover the complete command-engine qualification list from the proposal.
  - [ ] Timeout precedence, shared deadline, and every gate outcome.
  - [ ] `ONCE`, explicit retry-safe execution, receipts, effects, and attempt
