  - [ ] Intrinsic and optional caller verification.
  - [ ] Workflow steps, immutable outputs, and result projection.
  - [ ] Context restrictions and nested invocation ancestry.
  - [ ] Cleanup registration, abandonment, transaction states, claims,
        dependencies, planning, owner scopes, journal retention, projections,
        persistence, and quarantine.
  - [ ] `effect_absent` acceptance only during intrinsic verification for the
